WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.044
Shinjiro, ready to go?

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:04.671
Um, yes.

00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:09.050
But this is a new suit, right?

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:14.347
Yeah, our objective this time is only
to gather data for the operation system.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:17.726
Completing the suit and its design
will come later.

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:20.186
-Now then, please begin.
-Yes, sir.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.273
Listen up. We're sending
this drone out into the sky.

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:27.694
After ten seconds,
you'll chase after it and shoot it down.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:29.571
That's all.

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:31.197
Roger that.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:36.453
Three, two, one, start!

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:51.092
All right.

00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:09.527
I forgot to tell you this,
but that drone has lasers installed.

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:10.528
Be careful.

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:12.697
-How's Shinjiro doing?
-Say something sooner!

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:14.616
He's currently within the typical range.

00:01:14.699 --> 00:01:16.409
No data abnormalities.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:17.452
I see.

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:32.759
Mission cleared!

